* **Collaboration & Communication:** This is the biggest selling point. Open layouts inherently encourage spontaneous interaction and collaboration. People bump into each other, ideas are exchanged more easily, and teams can work together more fluidly.
* **Increased Transparency & Visibility:**  It’s easier to see what others are working on, which can foster a sense of shared purpose and accountability.
